'''Hallowscythe''' is an [[Ancient Weapons|ancient]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the 30th tier for 80,000 [[Candies (2020)|Candies]] {{Currency|Candies2020
}} during the [[Halloween Event 2020|2020 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
This weapon appears to be part halberd, and part scythe. It has a thin long handle, and the top blunt edge of the knife has a beak edge point to it. The color scheme is black, gray, and orange. The handle, top half of the blade, edge of the axe part, and the middle of the knife are black, the parts that slot the knife together are grey, and the other half of the scythe, axe, pommel and top of the knife are orange.   

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Hallowgun]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Hallow Set|Hallow Set]].
* This is one of the few scythes in game, the others being [[Nik's Scythe]], [[Batwing]], [[Icewing]], [[Elderwood Scythe]], [[Reaver]] and [[Gingerscythe|Gingerscythe.]]
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

